    },
    {
      "fact": "The 2026-27 school year still has 195 days, including 5 INSET days, which schools set themselves.",
      "source": "https://www.surreycc.gov.uk/schools-and-learning/schools/term-dates"
    },
    {
      "fact": "From September 2027 the council's schools go back to a one-week autumn half term (25 to 29 October 2027).",
      "source": "https://www.surreycc.gov.uk/schools-and-learning/schools/term-dates"
    },
    {
      "fact": "Surrey says dates for the 2028 to 2029 academic year will be published before 10 May 2027.",
